WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:02.239
Mr. Smith, you should've heard

2
00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.479
what we just talked about.

3
00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:05.519
En aquel entonces fue atropellado por un coche.

4
00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.079
and I sold myself to pay for his surgery.

5
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:07.999
Después de eso, lo entendí mal y

6
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.999
signed that agreement with you out of anger.

7
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.199
Does that mean

8
00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.679
you were forced to be with me?

9
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.480
¡Así es!

10
00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:14.519
I really don't want to be with you. ¡Así es!

11
00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:15.520
I really don't want to be with you.

12
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:16.479
Por eso no gasté ni un centavo

13
00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:17.799
que diste durante estos cinco años.

14
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.799
Because I don't want to owe you.

15
00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.199
Now that everything is resolved,

16
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.439
I want to return to him.

17
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:22.959
So, please Mr. Smith,

18
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:24.039
let me go, would you?

19
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.679
Of course, I'm grateful as well.

20
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.719
You've helped me a lot

21
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.839
when I was helpless.

22
00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:30.800
But my feeling for you

23
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.700
is only binded by our agreement.

24
00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:33.599
Eso es suficiente.

25
00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:34.679
Álex,

26
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.279
Déjalos ir.

27
00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:52.119
Clara.

28
00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:53.079
Simón,

29
00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:54.839
I need to tell you something.

30
00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.319
Please ignore what I just said

31
00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.119
in Henry's villa.

32
00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:03.719
I said that because

33
00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:05.519
I wanted to leave safely.

34
00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:06.079
te espero

35
00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:06.919
entender.

36
00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.079
¿Por qué?

37
00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:09.639
Forgive me, Simon.

38
00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:10.719
I was the one who

39
00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:11.959
betrayed you first.

40
00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.199
You didn't betray me.

41
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:15.919
Sólo te vendiste a él

42
00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.239
para salvarme.

43
00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:18.959
Al principio fue así.

44
00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:20.039
But later on,

45
00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:21.559
I did it because I was willing to.

46
00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:23.359
Are you in love with him?

47
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:25.999
si,

48
00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:28.559
Estoy enamorada de él.

49
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:32.479
Gracias por llevarme a casa.

50
00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:34.799
claire...
